parameters.help_en:
The mapping between schedule resource groups and data integration resource groups. Both the keys and values in the mapping are identifiers of resource groups. The format is as follows:

```json
{
    "SCHEDULER_RESOURCE_GROUP": {
        "xxx": "yyy"
    },
    "DI_RESOURCE_GROUP": {
        "ccc": "dfdd"
    }
}
```

